寵焉。及即位，使為政。田成子憚之，驟顧於朝。御鞅言簡公曰：「田、監不可并也，君其擇焉。」弗聽。子我夕，田逆殺人，逢之，遂捕以入。田氏方睦，使囚病而遺守囚者酒，醉而殺守者，得亡。子我盟諸田於陳宗。初，田豹欲為子我臣，使公孫言豹，豹有喪而止。後卒以為臣，幸於子我。子我謂曰：「吾盡逐田氏而立女，可乎？」對曰：「我遠田氏矣。且其違者不過數人，何盡逐焉！」遂告田氏。子行曰：「彼得君，弗先，必禍子。」子行舍於公宮。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000271","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000271","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"陽生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000433","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"監止","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001197","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"田成子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000270","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"御鞅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001198","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"簡公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000271","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"子我","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001199","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0073","start":73,"end":75,"surface":"田逆","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001200","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"田氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、族稱或未定指代；齊秉意茲等疑讀待版本校勘，不補熟知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0096","start":96,"end":99,"surface":"守囚者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、族稱或未定指代；齊秉意茲等疑讀待版本校勘，不補熟知姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-032-qi:m077-0110","start":110,"end":11